Credits for the imported data
=============================

The skill graph that //data:graph builds is imported from the Learning
Commons Knowledge Graph export, release v1.17.0, licensed under CC BY 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/; see LICENSE in this
directory). The export is downloaded at build time and is not stored in
this repository.

The import changes the data: it keeps a subset, converts it to a different
schema, and derives strands, lesson order, pacing and placements.

Each imported record keeps its author and attribution statement. These are
all the statements in the import, verbatim:

