Short step names (data/step-names.textproto)
============================================

The short names given to learning components in data/step-names.textproto
are adapted from the components' descriptions in the Learning Commons
Knowledge Graph, which Learning Commons received from Achievement Network
under CC BY-4.0. The adapted names are licensed under CC BY 4.0.
